<title>ITALY: SOCCER-INTER DRAW 1-1 WITH JUVENTUS IN ITALIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER DRAW 1-1 WITH JUVENTUS IN ITALIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Italian Cup second leg</p>
<p>quarter-final match on played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Internazionale 1 Juventus 1 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Inter: Maurizio Ganz 50</p>
<p>Juventus: Nicola Amoruso 42</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,300</p>
<p>Inter qualify for the semifinal 4-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
